# Everything that produced the numbers but is not needed to answer a request.
# Without this the build context is about 95 MB and the upload becomes the slow
# part of every deploy.
#
# Note what is NOT here: data/collect/raw/{helpcenter,faq,policies}. Those three
# are the knowledge base itself, and the Dockerfile copies them. Excluding their
# parent would make those COPY lines fail, so the two heavy siblings are named
# one by one instead.
.git
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo

# secrets - the key reaches the server as a fly secret, never inside an image
.env
.cache
.tiktoken_cache

node_modules
web/node_modules
web/src

data/corpus.jsonl
data/collect/raw/appstore
data/collect/raw/googleplay
data/collect/coverage_appstore.json
data/collect/coverage_gplay.json
data/kb/query_vectors
data/runs
data/sets
data/tickets

benchmark
docs
eval
scripts
README.md
